author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 480
acceptance_criteria: "One SDK primitive owns the load, verify, transform, re-anchor, reconcile and report pipeline for item history streams, and redact, repair and compact are expressed as transforms handed to it. cli/commands/copy.ts and cli/commands/restore.ts consume that primitive rather than re-implementing stream handling. The externally observable behaviour of every history command — flags, dry-run plans, applied reports, exit codes — is unchanged, asserted by the existing suites passing without modification. A jscpd run at 12 lines and 60 tokens reports no remaining clone pair inside the history family."
parent: pm-o2kc
